Personal Context Bridge

Original bridge code is MIT licensed. The adapted Health receiver,
upstream_smoke_test.py and protocol fixtures include Apache-2.0 PulsHealth code.
Their license and notice are preserved in third_party/pulshealth.
Modified receiver behavior includes SQLCipher storage, deletion tombstones,
canonical UUID identity, bounded reads, and encrypted backups.

The Mail CLI patch is for omarshahine/apple-pim at
4e155fc5a393c11fab8853565211422d02562a0a, under its MIT license, preserved in
third_party/apple-pim. Apple PIM binaries are not distributed here.

PulsHealth fixtures were obtained from public upstream commit
a1fb9b8ce5f1005c8c182c09e8577b76a1cb8865. They are synthetic protocol examples.
The Notes automation approach was inspired by krmj22/macos-mcp; this repository
provides its own bounded snapshot adapter. pytypedstream is an optional
installed dependency; its source is not vendored here.
